    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 223,
        "text": "Okay, everyone, thanks for coming. I want to talk about the new lunch menu. We sent a survey to 40 people last week, and 32 said they liked the menu. That's 80 percent. So I think we can say the menu is a big success.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "7756142fac19b2ec17d0c3bb57bba6022dfc1e258ae0148380f3a0aff29d4d5b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 230,
        "sourceEnd": 308,
        "text": "Wait, Maya. You said 40 people got the survey, but how many actually answered?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6431861edf44693bc45594424aa6a0059e798434775cac3578f454dd7004a8f2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 316,
        "sourceEnd": 364,
        "text": "Well, 32 people answered. That's the 80 percent.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "46768cc974f1dff7f840fea9123b278a7e25fcfd822939e2064e4a373b599aa1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 371,
        "sourceEnd": 464,
        "text": "Right, but that means only 32 out of 40 responded. And how many people work in this building?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d994ddaffe82766b7ec99166bf8b8db8e9c96680fc47525e308812763236f3b5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 472,
        "sourceEnd": 482,
        "text": "About 200.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3787334e31b15dadbb13568c4e0b9f9f9680c31a3460a0aba25c8f4fd8ace10b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 489,
        "sourceEnd": 651,
        "text": "So we only heard from 32 out of 200. That's 16 percent. We can't say the menu is a success for everyone. If we want a real answer, we need more people to respond.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "81eedd5690d1792019626d8b75dc8892579ed3f3ca8de4491b0f5f9567e1bf50",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 659,
        "sourceEnd": 771,
        "text": "Hmm, I see your point. But the 32 people who answered were very positive. Almost all of them said they liked it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a606b90912b56327c2280f338ba8092a9334eb34d7991ba60b9660487c67ed60",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 778,
        "sourceEnd": 908,
        "text": "Yes, but maybe the people who didn't like it didn't answer. That's a problem. If only happy people answer, the result is not fair.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "756cc602c0d2b60f5ee2212a2950a5f243c24094810af5ba11126b8ddaf36b16",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 916,
        "sourceEnd": 964,
        "text": "Okay, that's a good point. So what should we do?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "fc2688acbe89ee7e9d9cf5cb9441d61ac95c04c78c5f0a384aca3b8946a28c9b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 971,
        "sourceEnd": 1162,
        "text": "Let's send the survey again, but this time to all 200 people. And we can offer a small coffee coupon to people who finish it. If we get at least 100 answers, the result will be more reliable.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "626e883565fd196df5bfdc76340230eb8432c7232e04f4c039c8d5a5219a09d5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1170,
        "sourceEnd": 1305,
        "text": "That sounds good. But we need to check the results at the end of the month, not just at the end. We should do a stage check every week.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "75237b60f3f11be9901704658b3f927b21426bab0ec867d8424bcdd5c5081975",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1312,
        "sourceEnd": 1480,
        "text": "Agreed. So, first, we send the survey to everyone. Second, we check how many people answer each week. Third, if we have enough answers, we look at the results together.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "25fffba9524253b34fd7d4d0e81d4ff7b6765224a8f629dd7bce26616f6b362b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1488,
        "sourceEnd": 1653,
        "text": "Perfect. And let's also ask one question about the price. Some people said the lunch is too expensive. If we don't ask about price, we might miss an important issue.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cc50ca3463f1662cba79843ce8d850b6d60e5d1b44ab220b0f056dce0c829c0c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1660,
        "sourceEnd": 1872,
        "text": "Good idea. So the new survey will have three parts: taste, price, and variety. And we will compare the answers from different groups, like people who eat lunch here every day and people who bring lunch from home.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "bcf0a5224d1cce998c47dc83be258b9be6befa1d6739dd54ebfef64eee620cdb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1880,
        "sourceEnd": 1997,
        "text": "Yes, that's better. So we are not saying the menu is a success yet. We are saying we need more data before we decide.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ca3c767b3af652f7d5aa00ae22905210c4187d143f8dd6e9e1f6a2bb5f4ca23c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 2004,
        "sourceEnd": 2139,
        "text": "Exactly. And if the new results are different from the old ones, we will learn something important. That's the whole point of checking.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7753d897d15cab90113547907ebce65aff6eeea0b149723b4acdee164ffba03f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2147,
        "sourceEnd": 2217,
        "text": "Thanks, Ben. I'm glad we talked. Let's start the new survey on Monday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "17a6cb9ee79aa27aa93cecbc000fe216d9672175c9f0c7d0ffee29bcdf675e5e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
